==English==

===Noun===
{{en-noun}}

# {{lb|en|informal}} The person in [[charge]]; the highest-ranking person in an organization.
#: {{syn|en|big man|big enchilada|grand poobah|Thesaurus:important person}}
#: {{ux|en|The '''head honcho''' is hard to reach because they are too busy.}}
